    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "champ_0115_ecology_02",
      "hash64": "871598642D545016",
      "text": "Comment se passe ta Chasse au Trésor ?\\nTu fais des progrès ?[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "champ_0115_select_01",
      "hash64": "B2E6D23719592565",
      "text": "Oui, ça avance bien !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "champ_0115_select_02",
      "hash64": "B2E6CF371959204C",
      "text": "Je ne sais pas trop...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "champ_0115_ecology_03a",
      "hash64": "DE054D390646C078",
      "text": "Oh, c’est merveilleux ! Tu sembles avoir\\nun objectif clair. Quelle belle détermination ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "champ_0115_ecology_03b",
      "hash64": "DE0550390646C591",
      "text": "Ha ha, il faut dire que monsieur Clavel n’a pas\\ndonné d’objectif clair pour ce projet.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "champ_0115_ecology_04",
      "hash64": "87159A642D54537C",
      "text": "Tu sais, beaucoup d’élèves choisissent de passer\\nles examens d’Arène pour leur Chasse au Trésor.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "champ_0115_ecology_05",
      "hash64": "87159B642D54552F",
      "text": "C’est un gros défi à relever, bien sûr, mais\\nje pense que ça en vaut le coup.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "champ_0115_ecology_06",
      "hash64": "87159C642D5456E2",
      "text": "Et mon devoir de professeur principal me pousse\\nà encourager mes élèves.\\c\\nC’est pour ça que je suis venu jusqu’ici, d’ailleurs.\\nJ’ai quelque chose pour toi.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 158,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "champ_0115_ecology_07",
      "hash64": "87159D642D545895",
      "text": "Ceci devrait t’aider dans ta Chasse au Trésor.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "champ_0115_ecology_08",
      "hash64": "87159E642D545A48",
      "text": "À propos, j’espère que tu continues de remplir\\nle Pokédex.\\c\\nÇa me ferait bien plaisir étant donné que c’est\\nmoi qui ai développé cette application ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 150,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "champ_0115_ecology_09",
      "hash64": "87159F642D545BFB",
      "text": "Sur ce, je vais te laisser. Fais bien attention à ne\\npas t’aventurer dans des lieux trop dangereux.\\r\\nBon courage ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
